## Token Optimization

### Context Management
- Clear context when changing topics
- Keep essential project context
- Focus on current file/function
- Maintain minimal working context
- Prioritize recent information
- Remove redundant context

### Language Optimization
- Use concise, direct language
- Implement structured formats
- Avoid unnecessary pleasantries
- Remove redundant information
- Use lists over paragraphs
- Maintain clear hierarchy

### Content Organization
- Group related information
- Use logical hierarchies
- Implement clear structure
- Remove duplicate content
- Optimize references
- Maintain clarity

